# RazorFlow Design

Original identity. Do not inherit another project's look.

Reading: trust-first fintech product for merchants and judges. Quiet premium-neutral. Custom tokens. Liquid glass is one technique, not the brand.

Landing dials: variance 6, motion 5, density 4. Desk dials: variance 4, motion 4, density 6.

Tokens live in `src/app/globals.css`. Accent is settlement teal only. Fonts: Outfit + IBM Plex Mono. No Inter. No Fraunces. No Instrument Serif. No AI purple. No em dashes in UI copy. No crypto terminal.

Radius: controls 8px, panels 12px, glass overlays 16px. Phosphor icons only, one family, weight regular.

Glass only on agent surfaces, overlays, nav when it helps, high-value metrics, and primary financial controls. Solid fallback for `prefers-reduced-transparency`. Motion communicates state; honor `prefers-reduced-motion`.

A screen is a composition, not a pile of components. Financial numbers use tabular mono. Every important control needs hover, focus-visible, active, loading, success, error, empty, and disabled where relevant.
